# shir_nodes/element_read.node — ElementRead: index into an anonymous
# composite VALUE (`m["key"]` on a map literal, arr[i] on a literal,
# Java/Zig element reads on non-named collections).
#
# GENERIC. coll is any expression evaluating to a composite value; key
# stringifies like the host object model. Named-variable indexing keeps
# the existing A1 shapes (assocGet / arrayIndex / ${a[i]}) — THIS node
# covers only the expression-position form frontends previously had no
# shape for.

node ElementRead
tag "ElementRead"
kind expr
field coll: expr
field key: expr
